#-------------------

01:Mushu povidomyty, shcho teper ty perebuvaiesh u (name)
02:A, (name-n). Tse yakyis (name-n), spravdi chudova (name-adj) atmosfera, neimovirni (name-adj) vidchuttia. I teper, nu shcho zh, ty same tut
03:Harazd, otzhe, ty v (name-n), kruto, ale chy vin (name-adj)? Shche b pak
04:#dec_find-yourself# u (name);#dec_guess-what# (name)
05:Nu os my y opynylysia v #dec_a_the# (name)
06:Teper ty v #dec_a_the# (name)
07:Ty uviishov u (name);Ty shchoino #dec_walked_into# (name)
08:Mozhlyvo, tse tebe zdyvuie, ale ty shchoino #dec_entered# (name)
09:Ya #announce_mood#, shcho teper ty perebuvaiesh u (name)
010:A, (name-n). Tse yakyis (name-n), spravdi chudova (name-adj) atmosfera, neimovirni (name-adj) vidchuttia
011:Ty #dec_entered# u naibilsh (name-adj) z usikh mozhlyvykh (name-n)
012:Z usikh (name-n), u yaki ty mih #dec_walked_into#, tobi neodminno treba bulo #dec_walk_into# same v (name-adj)
013:Ty #dec_entered# u (name-n). Ne takyi (name-n), yakoho ty ochikuvav. Ni, tse (name)
014:Ty perebuvaiesh u (name-n). Tut, zdaietsia, dosyt (name-adj)
015:Ty #dec_what# u yakomus (name-adj) mistsi. Inakshe kazhuchy, ty perebuvaiesh u (name-n)
016:#dec_find-yourself# u (name-n). Dosyt (name-adj)
017:#dec_find-yourself# u (name-n). U yakomus (name-adj) mistsi
018:#017#
019:Ty #dec_entered# u (name-adj) kimnatu. Tvii mozok hariachkovo namahaietsia prydumaty, yakoiu mozhe buty (name-adj) kimnata. I tut tebe osiaiuie. Zvychaino. Ty v (name)
020:Yakshcho ty dyvuieshsia, chomu vse raptom stalo takym (name-adj), to tse tomu, shcho ty shchoino #dec_walked_into# (name)
021:Yaka nespodivana zustrich. Tut, do rechi, oznachaie v (name);Ya nikoly ne vvazhav tebe liudynoiu, yaka zyavytsia v (name), ale, skhozhe, pomyliavsia
022:Tse zvuchatyme neimovirno, ale ty shchoino uviishov u (name);Ty ne povirysh, ale ty shchoino uviishov u (name)
023:Ty efektno y ekstsentrychno vkhodysh u (name);Ty znovu efektno y ekstsentrychno vkhodysh u (name)
024:Podyvys na sebe, velykyi bos, zakhodysh u (name), niby tse yakas dribnytsia
