026:Ty bachyv i krashchi (name-n), ale tsei, zdaietsia, dosyt (name-adj);Ya prosto v zakhvati vid toho, shcho ty zaraz u (name);Ya prosto vvazhaiu chudovym, shcho ty shchoino uviishov u (name)
027:Tablychka #signquality# #sign# povidomliaie tobi, shcho teper ty v (name);Podyvys na tsiu #sign#! Shcho tam napysano? «Laskavo prosymo do (name)»? Nu, tse kruto
028:Ostannia novyna — ty v (name);Laskavo prosymo do (name);Oho! Ty v (name);Nu os my y u (name);Ty uviishov u (name);Tsei (name-n), do yakoho ty shchoino uviishov, bezperechno (name-adj)

