suffix:.;. Ty zdryhaieshsia, ale prodovzhuiesh ohliadaty kimnatu.;. Ty mymokhid dumaiesh, khto zalyshyv tse tut.;. Tsikavo, navishcho khtos zalyshyv tse tut?;. U tomu, shcho tse tut ye, ye shchos dyvne, ale ty ne mozhesh zrozumity, shcho same.;. U tomu, shcho tsia rich tut ye, ye shchos dyvne, ale zaraz u tebe nemaie chasu pro tse turbuvatysia.;. Khm, dyvno.;, nu y take.;!;. Khmmm... shcho shche, shcho shche?;. Oho, khiba TextWorld ne naikrashchyi?;. Ya prosto ne mozhu poviryty! Khiba TextWorld ne naikrashchyi?;. Ty ne mozhesh dochekatysia, shchob rozpovisty domashnim pro tse!;. Shchos promainulo v kutochku tvoho oka. Napevno, nichoho vazhlyvoho.;. Ty mymokhid dyvuieshsia, yak vony prydumaly nazvu TextWorld dlia tsoho mistsia. Vona duzhe vluchna.;. Raptom ty vdariaieshsia holovoiu ob steliu, ale udar ne nastilky sylnyi, shchob zavadyty tobi rozghliadaty predmety y navit rechi.;. Os tse ya nazyvaiu TextWorld!;. Klasychnyi TextWorld.;. Svitlo na sekundu merekhtyt, ale bilshe nichoho ne vidbuvaietsia.;.;.;.;#emptymainperiod#;#emptymain#;#empty1#;#empty2#;#empty3#;#empty4#;#empty5#;#empty6#;#empty7#;#empty8#;#empty9#;#empty10#;#empty11#;#empty12#;#empty13#;#empty14#;#empty15#;#empty16#;#empty17#;#empty18#;#empty19#;#empty20#;#empty21#;#empty22#;#empty23#;#empty24#;#empty25#;#empty26#;#empty27#;#empty28#;#empty29#;#empty30#;#empty31#;#empty32#;#empty33#;#empty34#;#empty35#;#empty30#;#empty31#;#empty32#;#suffix_price_schtick#;#suffix_fulfillment#;#suffix_meta#

